### Class Structure

```java
// 1. Package declaration and imports
// 2. Class-level annotations (@Slf4j, @Singleton, etc.)
// 3. Class declaration with Javadoc
// 4. Static constants (UPPER_SNAKE_CASE)
// 5. Injected fields (@Inject)
// 6. Constructors
// 7. Public methods
// 8. Protected methods
// 9. Private methods
// 10. Inner classes/records
```

