### Paths

Use `{{ variable }}` for values, `|` for filters, and `{% ... %}` for logic. For example, save this as `template.md`:

```knap
---
{{ title | yaml_property:"title" }}
{{ tags | yaml_property:"tags" }}
---
# {{ title | trim }}
{% if author %}
By {{ author }}
{% endif %}

{{ content }}
```

